  "about": "Putting solid shapes together and taking them apart: a cylinder with a cone on top makes a rocket, cubes in a row make a rectangular prism, and each part keeps its own name. NC.1.G.2 covers building with cubes, rectangular prisms, cones and cylinders, and NC.1.G.1 adds the flat faces and whether a solid rolls, stacks or slides.",
